{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 03 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">状态空间与 Mamba：长程传播、扫描偏置和 3D 代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">State Space &amp; Mamba</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_016_mamba-title\">Mamba</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">由当前输入生成 Δ、B、C 的 selective SSM，并用硬件感知并行 scan 执行。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Makes SSM discretization step Δ and projections B, C functions of the current input x_k, executed via a hardware-aware parallel associative scan.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">长度 N 的 token/连续信号序列</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sequence of N tokens or continuous signal samples</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">内容选择后的长程序列表示</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Content-selectively filtered long-range sequence representations</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.8</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=tEYskw1VY2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_016_mamba')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_016_mamba')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Mamba original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/803193cb08a016c2cc3c.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.8</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_016_mamba\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_016_mamba')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_016_mamba\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 Tokens</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input Tokens</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">序列先经线性层扩展并分成内容分支与门控分支。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests sequence of n tokens or continuous signal samples and prepares initial tensor representations (input Tokens).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"序列先经线性层扩展并分成内容分支与门控分支。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests sequence of n tokens or continuous signal samples and prepares initial tensor representations (input Tokens).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入 Tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"input Tokens\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 Tokens</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">序列先经线性层扩展并分成内容分支与门控分支。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests sequence of n tokens or continuous signal samples and prepares initial tensor representations (input Tokens).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"承担局部混合与状态空间更新的主信号。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"内容分支 x\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">内容分支 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">承担局部混合与状态空间更新的主信号。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"经 SiLU 产生与输入相关的输出门。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 03 within the core selective state space block computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"门控分支 z\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 03\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">门控分支 z</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 03</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">经 SiLU 产生与输入相关的输出门。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 03 within the core selective state space block computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"短核因果卷积在 selective scan 前编码局部邻域。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 1D DWConv within the core selective state space block computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"1D DWConv\" data-node-name-en=\"1D DWConv\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>1D DWConv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">短核因果卷积在 selective scan 前编码局部邻域。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 1D DWConv within the core selective state space block computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由当前 token 生成步长与输入/输出状态参数。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Δ/B/C within the core selective state space block computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Δ/B/C 选择器\" data-node-name-en=\"Δ/B/C\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Δ/B/C 选择器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Δ/B/C</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由当前 token 生成步长与输入/输出状态参数。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Δ/B/C within the core selective state space block computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"硬件感知并行扫描按 token 决定保留、忘记和输出状态。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Selective Scan within the core selective state space block computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Selective Scan\" data-node-name-en=\"Selective Scan\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Selective Scan</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">硬件感知并行扫描按 token 决定保留、忘记和输出状态。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Selective Scan within the core selective state space block computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"选择性状态输出与 z 分支逐元素门控。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SiLU Gate within the core selective state space block computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"SiLU Gate\" data-node-name-en=\"SiLU Gate\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>SiLU Gate</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">选择性状态输出与 z 分支逐元素门控。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SiLU Gate within the core selective state space block computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将扩展通道压回模型维度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies output projection to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"输出投影\" data-node-name-en=\"output projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输出投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">output projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将扩展通道压回模型维度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies output projection to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"块输入与投影输出相加形成深层 Mamba stack。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces content-selectively filtered long-range sequence representations via Residual.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Residual\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_016_mamba', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">块输入与投影输出相加形成深层 Mamba stack。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces content-selectively filtered long-range sequence representations via Residual.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Mamba Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · Mamba 的输入依赖离散化与选择性扫描</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Input-Dependent Selective Discretization &amp; Parallel Associative Scan</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Mamba：核心公式 · Mamba 的输入依赖离散化与选择性扫描\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"16\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.166374pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.773002 -68.992848 410.846471 11.166374\" width=\"410.846471pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m016_g7-0\"></path><path d=\"M2.064984-2.101212H.449225V-1.623005H2.064984V0H2.543191V-1.623005H4.158951V-2.101212