x=\"190.06558\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g16-67\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"193.301937\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g7-0\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"198.218292\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g23-49\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"204.566634\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g10-184\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"213.863932\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-22\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"220.371517\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g7-0\" y=\"-64.094849\"></use><use x=\"225.287873\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g23-49\" y=\"-64.094849\"></use><use x=\"229.920496\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g10-185\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"233.785999\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-52\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"238.548138\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g1-1\" y=\"-64.094849\"></use><use x=\"243.251899\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g13-67\" y=\"-63.003954\"></use><use x=\"246.831964\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g16-22\" y=\"-64.094849\"></use><use x=\"254.227576\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g10-0\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"263.18615\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-30\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"267.230964\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g10-186\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"271.435178\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-23\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"277.708159\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g16-67\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"281.151726\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-71\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"285.910382\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g16-67\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"289.353949\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-150\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"303.975728\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-72\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"308.834012\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g16-67\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"315.044911\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g4-61\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"323.98908\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-24\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"330.670523\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g16-67\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"334.472747\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g19-17\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"339.68968\" xlink:href=\"#m016_g16-67\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">固定 SSM 不擅长按内容选择保留、遗忘和输出信息</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Linear time-invariant SSMs (S4) use static transition matrices and cannot selectively remember or ignore tokens based on content.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">让状态更新参数随输入变化，并以硬件感知 selective scan 线性处理序列</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Parameterize (Δ_k, B_k, C_k) dynamically from input x_k and compute the resulting time-varying recurrence in SRAM via parallel prefix scan.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">input-dependent B、C、Delta 与并行 selective scan</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Input-dependent selective state updates + kernel-fused GPU associative scan achieving O(N) time and memory scaling.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">吸引 3D 分割、长生理信号和视频作为低成本全局 mixer</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Adopted across 3D volumetric segmentation, gigapixel WSI, and long physiological waveforms as a linear-complexity global mixer.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">序列领域重要；医学中尚无普遍替代 CNN/Transformer 的证据</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Major sequence modeling milestone; in 2D/3D medical imaging, standalone superiority over tuned CNNs/Transformers is not universal.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">固定 SSM 的参数被改为输入依赖选择器，使状态路由具有内容选择性。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">不显式构造 N×N attention 矩阵，序列长度方向保持线性 scan。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">局部 depthwise conv、选择性状态更新和输出门控承担不同时间尺度。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Parameterize (Δ_k, B_k, C_k) dynamically from input x_k and compute the resulting time-varying recurrence in SRAM via parallel prefix scan.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Input-dependent selective state updates + kernel-fused GPU associative scan achieving O(N) time and memory scaling.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Input-Dependent Selective Discretization &amp; Parallel Associative Scan.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合长生理信号或 3D bottleneck 中需要广域传递而 attention 成本过高的场景。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">线性阶不等于低实际延迟；state size、扫描方向、decoder 和内存搬运仍需测量。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Adopted across 3D volumetric segmentation, gigapixel WSI, and long physiological waveforms as a linear-complexity global mixer.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Major sequence modeling milestone; in 2D/3D medical imaging, standalone superiority over tuned CNNs/Transformers is not universal.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=tEYskw1VY2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Mamba: Linear-Time Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/state-spaces/mamba\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
